    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>https://chalithah.github.io/en/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://chalithah.github.io/en/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/LucasVadilho/heyo-hugo-theme&#34;&gt;heyo&lt;/a&gt; is a responsive, minimalist, and pretty theme built for &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/&#34;&gt;hugo&lt;/a&gt;, based on Alexander Bilz&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/lxndrblz/anatole&#34;&gt;Anatole&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;features&#34;&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; Dark theme&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://heyo-theme.oioipio.com/post/thumbnail/&#34;&gt;Cover images&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://heyo-theme.oioipio.com/post/sketches/&#34;&gt;Pretty visualizations&lt;/a&gt; in the sidebar&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://heyo-theme.oioipio.com/post/sketches/post/toc/&#34;&gt;Table of Contents&lt;/a&gt; in the sidebar&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://heyo-theme.oioipio.com/post/callouts/&#34;&gt;Callout shortcode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://heyo-theme.oioipio.com/post/badges/&#34;&gt;Badges shortcode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://heyo-theme.oioipio.com/post/custom/&#34;&gt;Support for custom CSS and JS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/content-management/multilingual/&#34;&gt;Multilingual support&lt;/a&gt; (english and brazilian portuguese, for now)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;https://gohugo.io/templates/internal/#configure-open-graph&#34;&gt;Open Graph&lt;/a&gt; support&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;quickstart&#34;&gt;Quickstart&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;To try the &lt;code&gt;exampleSite&lt;/code&gt; you just need to:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;git clone https://github.com/LucasVadilho/heyo-hugo-theme heyo&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;cd heyo/exampleSite &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; hugo server --themesDir ../..&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- raw HTML omitted --&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;live-preview&#34;&gt;Live preview&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;You can check a live preview at &lt;a href=&#34;http://heyo-theme.oioipio.com/&#34;&gt;heyo-theme.oioipio.com&lt;/a&gt;. Also, scan the QR code if you want to preview on mobile!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
